  "description": "Fuaran.MVU.React: mounts a Fuaran.MVU component in React. A model store React reads through useSyncExternalStore, one publish per drain, hydration over server-rendered markup with Init run once, hot reload that keeps the model where its shape allows and is compiled out of production builds, an element-view bridge for views that are React elements (which a governed surface refuses at compile time), and an after-the-next-paint effect kind with its performer. Depends on Fuaran.MVU, FSharp.Core, Fable.Core and Fable.React.Types; not on Feliz.",
